--------------------------------------------
         FAME64.txt v1.1 - updated
 ------------------------------------------
  All needed informations about the 64 bit
support in FAME v1.30 which will be used for
upload and download bytes to have a maximum
 space of 18.446.744.073.709.551.615 bytes
  (more than 18 trillion bytes) available.
This text is especially written for tool and
 door coders to support the 64 bit feature.
